### Expected Behavior

When running the pipeline I show below, I expect the Model to Produce the text "The weather is 22°C", show the tool call, and finally print "Done"


### Actual Behavior

Instead it prints "The weather is 22°C. Done.", the tool call, and then multiple chat messages of "The weather is 22°C. Done."

### Steps to Reproduce

Setup a pipeline 
```python
from typing import List, Union, Generator, Iterator


class Pipeline:
    class Valves(BaseModel):
        pass

    def __init__(self):
        self.valves = self.Valves()



    def pipe(
        self,
        user_message: str,
        model_id: str,
        messages: List[dict],
        body: dict,
    ) -> Union[str, Generator, Iterator]:

        yield {
            "choices": [{
                "delta": {"role": "assistant", "content": "The weather is 22°C. "},
                "finish_reason": None
            }]
        }


        yield {
            "choices": [{
                "delta": {
                    "tool_calls": [{
                        "index": 0,
                        "id": "call_123",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {"name": "get_weather_test", "arguments": '{"location": "SF"}'}
                    }]
                },
                "finish_reason": "tool_calls" 
            }]
        }


        yield {
            "choices": [{
                "delta": {"content": "Done."},
                "finish_reason": "stop"
            }]
        }
```

